This app includes these native libraries through libmpv-android
(https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android, wrapper code MIT), artifact dev.jdtech.mpv:libmpv:1.0.0:
- mpv (https://mpv.io)
- FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), built with --enable-gpl --enable-version3, so GPL version 3 or later
- dav1d, mbedTLS and libxml2, enabled in that FFmpeg build
Source and build scripts for this exact build: https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android/tree/v1.0.0
(tag v1.0.0, commit fcf6745703)

Network shares use smbj (https://github.com/hierynomus/smbj, Apache License 2.0) and Bouncy Castle (MIT-style licence).
SFTP uses sshj (https://github.com/hierynomus/sshj, Apache License 2.0), version 0.40.0.
FTP uses Apache Commons Net (https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-net/, Apache License 2.0), version 3.12.0.
WebDAV uses OkHttp (https://square.github.io/okhttp/, Apache License 2.0), version 4.12.0.

It also includes Tink (https://github.com/tink-crypto/tink-java), AndroidX and Jetpack Compose
(Apache License 2.0) and MaterialKolor (https://github.com/jordond/MaterialKolor).

Screenshots show Sintel and Big Buck Bunny, (c) Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0.

