The full build also includes youtubedl-android (https://github.com/JunkFood02/youtubedl-android, GPL-3.0), Apache Commons Compress (Apache License 2.0), and downloads yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp, Unlicense). The Play build has none of these.

